TUM Racetrack Database - License Information

The Spielberg track geometry and reference race line data are provided from the
TUM racetrack database, developed by the Technical University of Munich (TUMFTM).

Source: https://github.com/TUMFTM/racetrack-database
License: GNU LGPL v3

Reference:
- Heilmeier, A., Wischnewski, A., Hermansdorfer, L., Betz, J., Lienkamp, M., & Lohmann, B. (2020).
  Minimum curvature trajectory planning and control for an autonomous race car.
  Vehicle System Dynamics, 58(10), 1497-1527.

The data may be used according to the terms of the GNU LGPL v3 license.
Please cite the TUMFTM racetrack database and the reference publication above when using this data.
